  "method": "Each county's votes are the Totals row printed at the foot of its precinct table (Grand Totals for Hennepin and Ramsey), read twice, by the scan's text layer and by an OCR pass over each cell, with every disagreement read by eye; every county sum but St. Louis's matches the held state totals. The box is the printed cell.",
